{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conviction Chronicles is a multi-ending and dynamic horror adventure game. Your decisions will shape the story and seal your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/extras/e694df3a53140f872cde43cd0489b009.poster.avif?t=1768499427\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/extras/e694df3a53140f872cde43cd0489b009.webm?t=1768499427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/extras/e694df3a53140f872cde43cd0489b009.mp4?t=1768499427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day Time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Socialize with your fellow prisoners to forge alliances and gather intel for clues. Craft tools for survival or murder. Observe, manipulate and maybe suppress the truth. Everyone can be a potential asset, if you are clever enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Night Time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortify your cell or slip out to orchestrate your sinister plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/extras/40a3973c5eb2d04bb3def7a651314ec6.poster.avif?t=1768499427\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/extras/40a3973c5eb2d04bb3def7a651314ec6.webm?t=1768499427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of 15 prisoners to play as, each with unique play styles and deep backstories. Learn more about each of them every time you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft traps and weapons for self defense, deception, or murder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to investigate twisted cases or create them to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React, Retaliate, Reveal! The world is shaped by perception. Fast-paced trials will depend on your wits and lies to protect yourself from execution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deepen your relationships with others, or destroy them as dynamic events shape every playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay endlessly with over 100 hours of branching paths, randomized outcomes, and hidden content.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you build trust or twist it to your whim? Make allies\u2026 or make corpses. Only one truth remains: someone won\u2019t make it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/extras/7157f5e92152f0d1fead7481ba5c0f0f.poster.avif?t=1768499427\" width=590 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/extras/7157f5e92152f0d1fead7481ba5c0f0f.webm?t=1768499427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/extras/7157f5e92152f0d1fead7481ba5c0f0f.mp4?t=1768499427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3908320?t=1768499427","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/ab8d47031427290cae3dac391895e8c3161918d0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768499427","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/d2049003da2c8441a8080a0e32de5bafc44bb32c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768499427","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/d2049003da2c8441a8080a0e32de5bafc44bb32c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768499427","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Features mechanics based around planning murders.\r\n\r\nActions done upon someone sleeping:\r\n-Murdering the victim directly.\r\n-Drugging the victim to impact how they function during the next day or to kill them with drugs.\r\n-Playing a prank. Nothing sexual is even remotely implied here.\r\n-Tying someone up to the bed so they cannot leave the room, they can be untied too.\r\n\r\nCharacters with low self esteem can commit suicide.\r\n\r\nWhen playing certain characters, the camera can be moved in such a way to view the girl's panties.\r\n\r\nMany things are up to be changed during development before the game's release."},"demos":[{"appid":3908450,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conviction Chronicles is a multi-ending and dynamic horror adventure game. Your decisions will shape the story and seal your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/extras/e694df3a53140f872cde43cd0489b009.poster.avif?t=1768499427\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/extras/e694df3a53140f872cde43cd0489b009.webm?t=1768499427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/extras/e694df3a53140f872cde43cd0489b009.mp4?t=1768499427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day Time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Socialize with your fellow prisoners to forge alliances and gather intel for clues. Craft tools for survival or murder. Observe, manipulate and maybe suppress the truth. Everyone can be a potential asset, if you are clever enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Night Time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortify your cell or slip out to orchestrate your sinister plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/extras/40a3973c5eb2d04bb3def7a651314ec6.poster.avif?t=1768499427\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/extras/40a3973c5eb2d04bb3def7a651314ec6.webm?t=1768499427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of 15 prisoners to play as, each with unique play styles and deep backstories. Learn more about each of them every time you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft traps and weapons for self defense, deception, or murder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to investigate twisted cases or create them to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React, Retaliate, Reveal! The world is shaped by perception. Fast-paced trials will depend on your wits and lies to protect yourself from execution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deepen your relationships with others, or destroy them as dynamic events shape every playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay endlessly with over 100 hours of branching paths, randomized outcomes, and hidden content.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you build trust or twist it to your whim? Make allies\u2026 or make corpses. Only one truth remains: someone won\u2019t make it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/extras/7157f5e92152f0d1fead7481ba5c0f0f.poster.avif?t=1768499427\" width=590 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/extras/7157f5e92152f0d1fead7481ba5c0f0f.webm?t=1768499427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/extras/7157f5e92152f0d1fead7481ba5c0f0f.mp4?t=1768499427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Michael Richard Lannon"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/e4011548774d2c3898d15587e2840cfbf681e6f3/header.jpg?t=1768499427","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3908320/1418120832/aa5c96ebed1dc3fd8350cf377ba99d90c8f5338f/1753805182/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753965578","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3908320/1418120832/aa5c96ebed1dc3fd8350cf377ba99d90c8f5338f/1753805182/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753965578","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3908320/1418120832/aa5c96ebed1dc3fd8350cf377ba99d90c8f5338f/1753805182/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753965578","id":257175388,"name":"Official","thumbnail":"https://shared.